    "title": "Missing eGFR monitoring for TDF",
    "message": "Guidelines require eGFR monitoring for TDF at 3 months, 6 months, and then 6-12 monthly. The patient is on TDF and has hypertension, a risk factor for renal impairment. The current plan does not include scheduling the next eGFR test. The latest creatinine is 112 umol/L, but eGFR calculation and trend analysis are needed.",
    "issue_type": "monitoring_gap",
    "severity": "moderate",
    "recommended_action": "Schedule eGFR monitoring as per guideline: 6-12 monthly for patients on TDF, especially with hypertension.",
