    "alert_id": "PROTEINURIA_WITH_TDF_HYPERTENSION",
    "title": "Proteinuria with TDF and hypertension",
    "message": "Trace proteinuria is noted. Both TDF (renal toxicity) and hypertension can cause proteinuria. The clinician attributes it to hypertension alone, but TDF is a potential contributor given its known renal ADRs. This finding warrants closer renal monitoring, which is not in the plan.",
